# Contact form delivery. Set either one; the endpoint wins when both are set.
#
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT — a POST endpoint that accepts JSON and forwards to an
# inbox. Formspree is the quickest: create a form at https://formspree.io,
# then paste its endpoint here. Basin, Netlify Forms and a Cloudflare Worker
# all work the same way.
#
# VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL — fallback only. With no endpoint the form opens the
# visitor's own mail client with the brief pre-filled, which works but loses
# anyone without a configured desktop mail app.
#
# With neither set the form stays in review-only mode and tells the visitor to
# reach out on LinkedIn, so no brief is ever silently dropped.

VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=

# Absolute origin used by canonical tags, Open Graph and the sitemap. Defaults
# to the GitHub Pages project URL; set this once a custom domain is attached.
VITE_SITE_URL=
